  "title": "Asiad 2026: India's Squash Team Makes History",
  "summary": "Joshna Chinappa and Velavan Senthilkumar secured bronze in mixed doubles, while Anahat Singh made a comeback to win the women's singles squash final, marking India's first-ever medal in the women's singles competition.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Joshna Chinappa and Velavan Senthilkumar settled for bronze after a heartbreaking loss to Hong Kong's Tang Ming Hong and Lee Ka Yi in a closely fought mixed doubles match.",
